    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match-3 meets roguelike! In <i>Chainward</i>, embark on a thrilling journey where you'll defeat monsters, face epic bosses, explore diverse locations, and perfect your deck of items and relics to create powerful synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Match-3 Gameplay</h2>Connect items in chains to unleash powerful effects. But think carefully\u2014your matches are the key to survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike Progression</h2>Start your journey with a simple pack of items and forge your path through randomly picked locations filled with danger and opportunity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Relics and Synergies</h2>Collect unique relics that amplify your abilities and open up new strategies. Build devastating combos and create synergies that suit your playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Locations</h2>Each stop on your journey presents choices. Will you risk it all in a monster cave, relax at a tavern, or maybe do a little donation to the church?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready to forge your destiny, one chain at a time?</h2>",
